Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picompose-software-ha-satellite
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Home Assistant voice satellite for PiCompose
 Compose projects that turn a PiCompose system into a Home Assistant voice
 satellite: the Linux voice assistant, a Snapcast client, a Music Assistant
 Local Audio player for audio playback and a Bluetooth proxy.
 .
 The projects are copied to /compose, where the PiCompose compose manager
 deploys them. docker-compose.yml is updated with the package, picompose.conf
 and .env are only written on first installation. The Linux voice assistant and
 the Local Audio player are enabled, the Snapcast client and the Bluetooth
 proxy are disabled until they are enabled in their picompose.conf.
